      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Reshade is an extremely powerful tool, having access to colour adjustments, various filters, FXAA, CAS, etc, are all very nice and some of them very useful.  CAS improves visibility and clarity in VR significantly for almost no performance cost.\nFSR is different and actually performs AI upscaling, instead of just being a really good sharpening algorithm.  It has methods that conflict with EAC.\nI think these tools more just need to be fixed to work inside EAC than needing them implemented in the client.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
