  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-18T03:28:31.929Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "What about applying the Contrast addaptive sharpen effect as part of the visual adjustment function, although the effect is similar to FSR?\nI have been using a Reshade effect called VRToolkit to improve the 3D effect.\nThe VRtoolkit effect is done in one pass and is much lighter and has less performance impact than LumaSharpen, for example.\nI think it would be good to have the 3D effect as part of the visual adjustment function.\nVRToolkit also has effects such as dithering effects.\nThis would be helpful when applying the FSR effect, which is on another agenda.\nhttps://vrtoolkit.retrolux.de",
